  "instructions": [
    "Rinse quinoa and brown rice under cold water until clear.",
    "In a bowl whisk miso paste, soy sauce, coconut milk, garlic, and ginger until smooth.",
    "Add quinoa, rice, sweet potato, and coconut flakes to the bowl, stir to coat everything evenly.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a sheet pan and spread out in a single layer.",
    "Roast in a preheated oven at 400°F for 30 minutes, stirring halfway through.",
    "Check that sweet potatoes are tender and grains are lightly browned.",
    "Remove from oven and let sit for 5 minutes.",
    "Serve warm in bowls, garnish with fresh cilantro if desired."
